# The machine-wide ~/.npmrc sets `allow-scripts=@opencode/cli`, which blocks every other
# dependency's install script. That is a pnpm 10-era key; pnpm 12 reads build approval from
# `allowBuilds` in ./pnpm-workspace.yaml instead, which is where this project grants it to esbuild
# (Vite's native bundler binary ships via a postinstall hook).
#
# This file is intentionally left without an `onlyBuiltDependencies` entry: that key is read but does
# not authorise the build under pnpm 12, so declaring it here would only mislead the next reader.
# See ./pnpm-workspace.yaml.
